{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12113160","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12113160","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1211316001:0":{"text":"你们听见了吗，那个亡灵女人说辛巴达正在和他们的舰队周旋！","source_cn":"你们听见了吗，那个亡灵女人说辛巴达正在和他们的舰队周旋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56F1F395E40BE058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211316002:1":{"text":"波妮……你们还不了解她。我们交过很多次手。","source_cn":"波妮……你们还不了解她。我们交过很多次手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF023AC355412AC47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211316003:0":{"text":"除了指挥作战，她用弓也很强。几次海上相逢，我们的船能靠机动性杀出一条血路，但她会精准狙击导航士或舵手。","source_cn":"除了指挥作战，她用弓也很强。几次海上相逢，我们的船能靠...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88897C4B0FEBA50A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211316004:0":{"text":"只需要片刻慌乱，那群亡灵就能搭起钩索和绳梯，然后就是刀尖白刃的接舰战。不知道有多少兄弟姐妹折在她手上。","source_cn":"只需要片刻慌乱，那群亡灵就能搭起钩索和绳梯，然后就是刀...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31B4AC92C91C92CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211316005:0":{"text":"如果能在这里干掉她，就能断掉霍德希金一条手臂……！","source_cn":"如果能在这里干掉她，就能断掉霍德希金一条手臂……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C54F235606EE509","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","docu